  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners: Entrepreneurship Enabler training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners (OC) aims to strengthen entrepreneurial ecosystems in emerging markets by enhancing the quality of local entrepreneurship enablers. Many OC hubs operate in nascent ecosystems where skilled enablers are limited.This project equips Orange Corners hubs with the expertise, skills and tools to successfully deliver the Board Member training. This will result in enhanced capacity of entrepreneurship enablers and lead to a greater overall success of startups.</narrative>
  </description>
